# Summary

The handbook states that vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook[[cite:obs-e80ff27e617fdda0020ae89f2ddd9abab7dea965 "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].

The appendix specifies that bays twelve through thirty are blocked, reserved for supplier vans only, with a midday deadline[[cite:obs-82708e9bb04cefecc1ca0ec435e928f0854ad625 "Bays twelve through thirty: blocked, supplier vans only, midday deadline."]].
